Now, let me review the data in your\nPok\edex for a moment[.]

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_SeenCaughtLeft
You have seen [BUFFER1] Pok\emon, and\ncaught [BUFFER2]. That leaves [BUFFER3] left\lto catch. My rating is[.]

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_LessThanSeventyFivePercentPokedex
Come see me once you have\ncompleted 75% of your Pok\edex.\pI'll have something nice to give you.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_IncompletePokedex
Come see me once you have\ncompleted your Pok\edex.\pI'll have something nice to give you.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_GiftAvailable
Come see me when you can.\nI have something nice to give you.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_EvaluationComplete
Thank you for showing me your\nPok\edex, [PLAYER]. You've made\lgreat progress.

#org @gText_VendingMachinesChoice
A vending machine! What would you\nlike?

#org @gText_VendingMachinesNotEnoughMoney
You don't have enough money[.]

#org @gText_VendingMachinesChoseNotTo
Changed your mind!

#org @gText_VendingMachinesOneItem
