#org @gText_VendingMachinesTwoItems
Got a can of [BUFFER1]! A freebie\npopped out too!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_AdvicePrompt
I have some advice for you[.]

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_FiftyOrLessCaught
Your journey is just beginning.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_FiftyOrLessCaught_Advice
Keep an eye out for new Pok\emon as\nyou explore and you'll make great\lprogress.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_OneHundredOrLessCaught
You have quite a ways to go.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_OneHundredOrLessCaught_Advice
Search everywhere for Pok\emon.\nThey can hide in grass, caves, and\lwater.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_OneHundredFiftyOrLessCaught
Your Pok\edex is coming along\nnicely.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_OneHundredFiftyOrLessCaught_Advice
Some Pok\emon can only be obtained\nby hatching eggs or evolving\lPok\emon.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_TwoHundredOrLessCaught
You've caught roughly half of the\nregion's Pok\emon now!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_TwoHundredOrLessCaught_Advice
Don't forget to use your fishing rod!\nSome Pok\emon are easier to find\lwhen fishing.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_TwoHundredFiftyOrLessCaught
You've caught quite a lot of Pok\e\nmon now!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_TwoHundredFiftyOrLessCaught_Advice
Some Pok\emon can be difficult\nto discover. Try using the DexNav\lto find them.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ThreeHundredOrLessCaught
You've caught a significant amount of\nPok\emon now!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ThreeHundredOrLessCaught_Advice
Check your Pok\edex from time to\ntime for empty spaces, to see if\lany Pok\emon you've caught may be\lcapable of evolution.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ThreeHundredFiftyOrLessCaught
You're so close to completing your\nPok\edex!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ThreeHundredFiftyOrLessCaught_Advice
Some incredibly powerful Pok\emon will\nonly reveal themselves to you if\lyou are a Champion-level trainer.\pIt's worth revisiting old locations\nto see if anything has changed.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ThreeHundredFiftyOrMoreCaught
You're almost there!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ThreeHundredFiftyOrMoreCaught_Advice
Just keep doing what you're doing,\nand you'll complete the Pok\edex in\lno time!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ShinyCharmAward
[PLAYER]! You've caught at least 75%\nof all Pok\emon in Kulure!\pI have a special gift for you[.]\pPlease, accept it with my gratitude.

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_ShinyCharmDescription
[BLUE]This incredible charm draws more\nShiny Pok\emon to you.\pYou may find that one in one\nhundred Pok\emon are shiny, even!\pHohoho!\pIt is quite the reward, isn't it?

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_AllCaught
Incredible! You've captured every\nPok\emon in the region. You are a\ltruly special trainer, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_PokedexAssessment_AllCaughtDiploma
[BLUE]I'll present you with this Diploma,\nwhich celebrates your achievement.

