#org @gText_UndergroundMining_Offer
The wall is bulging slightly.\nTry digging into it?

#org @gText_UndergroundMining_DisplayPossiblePrizes
Something pinged in the wall!\n[BUFFER1] confirmed!

#org @gText_UndergroundMining_Instructions
[.]\pOh? There's a note taped inside\nthe ADM.\p"Digging for Treasure!\"\pThe ADM comes equipped with its\nvery own sledgehammer and pickax!\pPress [A_BUTTON], and ye'll be able to dig\nout all sorts of stuff!\pIf at any point ye want to change\ntools, just press [L_BUTTON] or [R_BUTTON]!\pI'm sure ye can dig them out\nbefore the wall comes tumblin'\ldown!\pYe can do it!\nGood luck!

#org @gText_UndergroundMining_WallCollapsed
The wall collapsed!

